                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2753323,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And so what's the situation going forward?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 305.175,
                  "from": 301.735,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2753331,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Community organizations, environmental groups, and the British Columbia government are now working together on the problem.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 314.18,
                  "from": 305.815,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2753348,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The government is now requiring logging companies to adopt a better logging method, which is a positive step. However, these measures alone may not be sufficient to ensure a healthy population of the spirit bear in the future. Other steps also need to be taken. While it is important to maintain the spirit bear's habitat, there also needs to be more emphasis on its expansion. The move is justified as it will also create space for other bears that are losing their homes to",
